s\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788570559391450404,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"72fa98a6-b925-4ddb-acf0-570da81b6d9d","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"96c4-bbbe-02ab-415e"},{"link_uuid":"3db8f829-cbe2-48e9-be3e-403d7ae5a263","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"67f9-4218-65e7-4f4a"},{"link_uuid":"836ff305-a1ca-4668-a15d-8bf3ac55c47c","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"1070-f7f3-c7b7-48e3"},{"link_uuid":"3f3df97d-39a8-420a-a544-9a933fd05d4c","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"7053-e17d-31f4-4e54"},{"link_uuid":"b87e7b4c-9aeb-4229-a107-389798e8058e","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"4199-7234-8e59-4633"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe infra/terraform cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `infra/terraform/opcert-plan-assertions.sh:1-24,48-55,97-105` — Preserve post-apply/no-change plan requirement for computed values, credential requirement, usage, address-scoped assertions, write-only-key check. Consumer: operators/CI.\n- `infra/terraform/opcert.tf:1-20,32-53,91-95,127-153` — Preserve existing-host/pay-per-request architecture, SigV4 plus origin guard, key ownership/rotation semantics, exact invoke grant, operator-managed trust list. Consumer: Terraform/security/operators.\n- `infra/terraform/ssm.tf:1-19,35-103,112-137,174-202` — Preserve write-only secret-slot contract, exact consumers and required/optional distinctions, non-secret Jira parameter ownership, import blocks’ adoption purpose. Consumer: Terraform/boot scripts/security.\n- `infra/terraform/user_data.sh:19-33,94-128,149-181` — Preserve shared device-resolution fallback, scratch mount must fail loudly, root declaration versus volume proof markers, Terraform-template escaping constraints, deliberately excluded OAuth parameters. Consumer: cloud-init/Terraform/ShellCheck.\n- `infra/terraform/versions.tf:4-17,29-33` — Preserve Terraform ≥1.11 for write-only values and ≥1.10 locking, old clients are unsafe, AWS provider floor supports write-only SSM, random/archive consumers. Consumer: Terraform.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"infra/terraform/opcert-plan-assertions.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/terraform/opcert.tf","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/terraform/ssm.tf","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/terraform/user_data.sh","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/terraform/versions.tf","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","49ac-d7e5-f383-4d7f"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"49ac-d7e5-f383-4d7f","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"7301-b191-dea1-4e0b","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in infra/terraform — cohort 02: opcert-plan-assertions–versions","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["0cbccced-9a0d-49f2-bde6-54eadfe27b86","de2f4104-648b-4811-8a9f-21b47be4fc89","72fa98a6-b925-4ddb-acf0-570da81b6d9d","3db8f829-cbe2-48e9-be3e-403d7ae5a263","836ff305-a1ca-4668-a15d-8bf3ac55c47c","3f3df97d-39a8-420a-a544-9a933fd05d4c","b87e7b4c-9aeb-4229-a107-389798e8058e"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788582660644355001,"uuid":"8cbe4091-56d0-4ff1-a68c-3ee130b19e6f"}